{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-42465" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 8 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & \\sqrt{6} & 9 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 4 & \\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \n\nConsider the matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0?$\n\n- $A$ has proportional rows\n- $A$ has identical columns\n- $A$ has a zero column" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-42465" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's examine each of the statements in turn.\n\n- $A$ has proportional rows: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 8 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & \\sqrt{6} & 9 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 4 & \\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}]\\,✓\n$$\n\n- $A$ does *not* have identical columns.\n\n- $A$ does *not* have a zero column.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-42465" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b7c77cf1b4747719924623178ad00c050567b110a83d7203c3a514f1e7a1d0c8"} {"question" "q-42465" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-42465" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "I and II only"] ["text" "I only"] ["text" "II and III only"] ["text" "II only"] ["text" "III only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-42465" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "I only"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-42957" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 10 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0?$\n\n- $A$ has identical columns\n- $A$ has a zero column\n- $A$ has identical rows" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-42957" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's examine each of the statements in turn.\n\n- $A$ does *not* have identical columns.\n\n- $A$ has a zero column: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 10 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\,✓\n$$\n\n- $A$ has identical rows: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 10 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\,✓\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-42957" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b7c77cf1b4747719924623178ad00c050567b110a83d7203c3a514f1e7a1d0c8"} {"question" "q-42957" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-42957" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "I and II only"] ["text" "I only"] ["text" "II and III only"] ["text" "II only"] ["text" "III only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-42957" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "II and III only"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-43057" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Which of the following determinants are equal to $0?$\n\n$$\n|A|=|\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & -6 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 8 & 2\\end{aligned}|,\\,|B|=|\\begin{aligned}1 & \\sqrt{2} & 4 \\\\ 2 & 2\\sqrt{2} & 8 \\\\ 0 & -\\sqrt{3} & 4\\end{aligned}|,\\,|C|=|\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\sqrt{3} & 4 \\\\ 0 & 3 & \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}|.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-43057" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's examine each of the given determinants in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ is a triangular matrix, hence \n\n$$\n|A|=3\\cdot (-6)\\cdot 2=-36\\ne 0.\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ has proportional rows: \n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\sqrt{2} & 4 \\\\ 2 & 2\\sqrt{2} & 8 \\\\ 0 & -\\sqrt{3} & 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nAs a result, $|B|=0.$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is a triangular matrix, hence \n\n$$\n|C|=(-1)\\cdot 3\\cdot 4=-12\\ne 0\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $|B|$ is equal to $0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-43057" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b7c77cf1b4747719924623178ad00c050567b110a83d7203c3a514f1e7a1d0c8"} {"question" "q-43057" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-43057" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "$|A|$ and $|B|$ only"] ["text" "$|A|$ and $|C|$ only"] ["text" "$|A|$ only"] ["text" "$|B|$ only"] ["text" "$|C|$ only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-43057" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "$|B|$ only"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-82289" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Which of the following determinants are equal to $0?$\n\n$$\n|A|=|\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}|,\\,|B|=|\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 2 & \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & -8\\end{aligned}|,\\,|C|=|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & \\sqrt{5} & -2\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 0 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-82289" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's examine each of the given determinants in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ is a diagonal matrix, hence \n\n$$\n|A|=4\\cdot (-2)\\cdot 3=-24\\ne 0.\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ has a zero column: \n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 2 & \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & -8\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nAs a result, $|B|=0.$\n\n- The matrix $C$ has proportional columns: \n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & \\sqrt{5} & -2\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 0 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nAs a result, $|C|=0.$\n\nTherefore, only $|B|$ and $|C|$ are equal to $0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-82289" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b7c77cf1b4747719924623178ad00c050567b110a83d7203c3a514f1e7a1d0c8"} {"question" "q-82289" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-82289" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "$|A|$ and $|B|$ only"] ["text" "$|A|$ and $|C|$ only"] ["text" "$|B|$ and $|C|$ only"] ["text" "$|B|$ only"] ["text" "$|C|$ only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-82289" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "$|B|$ and $|C|$ only"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-140049" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $A$ be a $2\\times 2$ matrix such that $|A|\\ne 0.$ Which of the following statements must be true?\n\n- $A$ is a triangular matrix\n- $A$ does not have identical rows\n- $A$ does not have proportional columns" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-140049" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's consider our statements in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. For example, consider the matrix \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWe have that \n\n$$\n|A|=1\\cdot 1-(-2)\\cdot 2=5\\ne 0\n$$\n\nbut $A$ is not a triangular matrix.\n\n- Statements II and III are true. Indeed, we can make use of the following fact:\n\n$|A|=0$ *if and only if one of the rows/columns of $A$ is a linear combination of other rows/columns of $A.$*\n\nIn the case of a $2\\times 2$ matrix, this means that one of the rows/columns must be proportional to another row/column.\nHence, if $|A|\\ne 0$ then $A$ doesn't have proportional nor identical rows/columns.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-140049" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b7c77cf1b4747719924623178ad00c050567b110a83d7203c3a514f1e7a1d0c8"} {"question" "q-140049" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-140049" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "I only"] ["text" "II and III only"] ["text" "II only"] ["text" "III only"] ["text" "None of the statements are true"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"} {"question" "q-140049" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "II and III only"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063508/state.json" "file_sha256" "da733cd8b8fae6ce32f1927931f728fc54ea2a5cf648caa4728d10d6152cdd54"}] "usage" {} "basis" 2208 "retractions" [] "immutable_answers" [] "immutable_fields" [] "no_history" []}
